**DIRAC
.TITLE
  LiH
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
.PROPERTIES ! Activate property module (dipole moment; polarizability...)
**GENERAL
! Direct evaluation of two-electron integrals
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*TWOINT
#.SOFOCK
**HAMILTONIAN
!.SPINFREE
!.LEVY-LEBLOND
.URKBAL
.PRINT
1
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.DHF
#.MP2
*DHFCAL ! DHF specifications...
.CLOSED SHELL
4 0
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0E-10  1.0D-7
#.CNVINT
#1.0D-4 1.0D-15
###########################################################
#
# Set up properties
#
############################################################
**PROPERTIES ! Calculating of properties...
.PRINT
1
.SHIELDING
#.NSTDIA
*NMR
.INTFLG
1 1 0
.LONDON
#.NOORTH
#.NOONEI
#.NOTWO
#.SYMCON
#.NOEPRN
#.NOLOND
#.GAUGEO
#0.0  0.0  0.0
*LINEAR RESPONSE
#.SKIPEP
.MAXITR
100
.INTFLG
1 1 0
.THRESH
1.0D-9
.PRINT
1
*EXPECTATION VALUE
.PRINT
1
*END OF



